ld.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Its second job \u2014 turning scraped text into legacy genomes and deploying them straight into the population \u2014 is deleted; there is one strategy-creation path and it runs through the Strategist and the Analyst."}, {"id": "trader_brain_scraper_idea_score", "label": "idea_score()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-01-scraper-outside-world.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "trader_brain_scraper_research_score", "label": "research_score()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-01-scraper-outside-world.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "idea_score rewards trading jargon and is right for prebuilt strategies, but a realistic research paragraph about funding and open interest scored 0 on it. Research prose asserts that an observable predicts something, in a scope, ideally with a magnitude \u2014 different words entirely, so a second screen is needed rather than a looser one."}, {"id": "trader_brain_scraper_streams_for", "label": "streams_for()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-01-scraper-outside-world.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "An item may serve both consumers."}, {"id": "trader_brain_scraper_scrape_tv_scripts", "label": "Scraper.scrape_tv_scripts()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-01-scraper-outside-world.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "/ideas/ is chart commentary \u2014 452 of 452 items queued from there were bare headlines with no mechanis